    "c72c8bb7-e8bd-4619-9795-25e43a4528cc": {
      "type": "multicolumn",
      "blocks": {
        "template--14646129197122__c72c8bb7-e8bd-4619-9795-25e43a4528cc-1684873350930a6a0f-0": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "",
            "text": "<p>\"Popped in for breakfast on a Saturday morning. Service was super efficient and everyone was quite nice. The iced coffee was strong but not bitter at all, and we were full from a bacon burrito and avocado bagel. Also got a bag of coffee beans as a gift for my mom because we enjoyed the coffee so much. Super welcoming atmosphere and is situated next to a high end thrift, ‘Oak Street Vintage.’ Until next time!\"</p><p><em>-Ally Ruiz Balcerzak</em></p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "template--14646129197122__c72c8bb7-e8bd-4619-9795-25e43a4528cc-1684873350930a6a0f-1": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "",
            "text": "<p>\"As someone who appreciates certain qualities and details that make up a great coffee shop, I'm here to tell you this place hits all the basic marks with ease, and is one of the most satisfying places I've been in a long time.\"</p><p><em>-Carrie Beth McWithey</em></p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "template--14646129197122__c72c8bb7-e8bd-4619-9795-25e43a4528cc-1684873350930a6a0f-2": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "",
            "text": "<p>\"Charming coffee shop with terrific coffee and food, adjacent parking and lots of seating. The space inside and out is clean and has tons of character. We ordered two oat milk lattes which were delicious. Nice selection of breakfast treats. The frittata sandwich was yummy.\"</p><p><em>-Chris Roddle</em></p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "495d9e4b-8853-41c4-bcf2-b2e7bd47c345": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "",
            "text": "<p>\"Holy cow, how is this not 5 stars. This is the best latte and breakfast sandwiches we’ve ever had. The biscuits are incredible, the sandwiches are some of the best we’ve had, the coffee is awesome, the service is above and beyond. This place deserves to be 5 stars and definitely come here.\"</p><p><em>-Jillie Johnston</em><br/></p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        }
      },
